est game.","The points rating beside it is the model the Teams pages rank on (the points a game we expect against an average side); it has no game-by-game history, so the weekly ranking cannot use it.","Players: this season's league games, qualified by minutes in the formation role started most (the rule is under each group). GAR/90 is our value model's goals added per 90 over a replacement-level player in the same role."]}